{"id":"955facc376d59b85","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-extendible.md","title":"Extendible Cardinal","display":"df-extendible — Extendible Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-extendible","aliases":["58-df-extendible"],"display":"df-extendible — Extendible Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-extendible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-extendible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extendible — Extendible Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e8e27514727b12c\" href=\"?note=3e8e27514727b12c\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\">\\(V_\\lambda\\)</span> 是累积层级（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta)\\)</span> 同时绑定两个秩段的成员结构、初等嵌入及临界点条件（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e8e27514727b12c\" href=\"?note=3e8e27514727b12c\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extendible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda)\\to\\exists\\theta,j\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extendible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda)\\to\\exists\\theta,j\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-extendible if there is an elementary embedding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j: V_{\\kappa+n} \\to V_{j(\\kappa)+n}\">\\(j: V_{\\kappa+n} \\to V_{j(\\kappa)+n}\\)</span> with critical point <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li>Extendible cardinals are stronger than supercompact in the hierarchy</li>\n<li>They are related to the existence of I_0, the large cardinal at the top of the inner model hierarchy</li>\n<li>核心四元谓词已构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda,V_\\theta\">\\(V_\\lambda,V_\\theta\\)</span> 的集合编码成员结构；本兼容定义不再把裸集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> 或未绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\alpha\\)</span> 直接传给结构嵌入谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"3e8e27514727b12c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-lc-extendible-cardinal-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$（see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a3